  m_text: 'You have a tiny cursor (That dot on the left side)

    Which is followed
    by a crosshair (that circle)

    Which is the point to which your ship is aiming.


    The
    hard part is that the crosshair following your cursor and the ship following
    it''s crosshair have different speeds. THat makes aiming really difficult.


    You''ll
    get the hang of it soon.'
